# Nova runs inside Linux containers: shell scripts break outright on CRLF
# ("syntax error: unexpected ||", bad interpreter) and the freshness check
# hashes disk-vs-container, so ANY checkout-time CRLF conversion makes the
# tree lie. The 2026-08-24 merge checkout (Windows, core.autocrlf=true)
# CRLF'd 364 tracked files and baked broken scripts into two images.
# Force LF for everything text; no Windows-only files exist (.ps1 runs fine
# with LF in PowerShell 5+).
* text=auto eol=lf
